  "statuteText": "262:12 Taking Without Owner's Consent. –\n\nIf any person shall willfully, or mischievously take, drive, or use any motor vehicle without the consent of the owner or person having control thereof, but not with intent to steal the same, he shall be guilty of a misdemeanor."
